# Allowlist .gitignore.
#
# Rule: deny everything, then re-include named public paths. A denylist
# leaks the manuscript the first time somebody adds a file, and a leak in a
# public history cannot be undone by deleting the file later.
#
# Anything not named below is private. To publish a new file, add one line
# here and re-run the split audit.

/*

# --- public root files ---------------------------------------------------
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/README.md
!/CITATION.cff
!/LICENSE
!/pyproject.toml
!/main.py
!/requirements.txt
!/requirements-lock.txt

# --- public directories --------------------------------------------------
!/src/
!/DATA/
!/results/
!/tests/

# --- scripts: only named computation scripts are published ---------------
!/scripts/
/scripts/*
!/scripts/record_environment.py
!/scripts/build_data.py
!/scripts/run_experiments.py
!/scripts/make_figures.py

# --- never published, wherever they appear -------------------------------
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.pytest_cache/
*.docx
*.doc
*.tex
*.bib
*.bbl
*.aux
*.synctex.gz
*.zip
*.pdf
*.eps
.env
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
secrets.*

# --- the one published exception: figures are computation output ---------
!/results/figures/*.pdf
!/results/figures/*.eps
